      <title>A Healthcare Prescription For The 120th Congress</title>
      <description>In the ER, the first priority is to resuscitate the patient, followed by devising a plan to retore their health. Congress should adopt a similar strategy for healthcare.</description>
      <dc:creator>Arthur L. Kellermann, Contributor</dc:creator>
      <atom:author>
        <atom:name>Arthur L. Kellermann, Contributor</atom:name>
        <atom:uri>https://www.forbes.com/sites/arthurkellermann/</atom:uri>
      </atom:author>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">content_6aef3c6d9d304c80500dcf56</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 12:15:00 -0500</pubDate>
      <atom:updated>2026-11-09T12:42:55-05:00</atom:updated>
